2. The following offences may be compounded by the Commissioner in accordance with section 62 of the Act:
(a)any offence (other than a continuing offence) under section 7(7), 16(5) or (6), 25(7), 33(3)(a), 34(3)(a), 35(4), 40(2), 41(2), 42(2), 43(2), 44(2), 45(2), 47(2), 48(2), 50(3) or 54(5)(a) of the Act;
(b)any offence under regulation 30 of the Amusement Rides Safety Regulations 2011 (G.N. No. S 343/2011);
(c)any offence under the Amusement Rides Safety (Fire and Rescue Management System) Regulations 2011 (G.N. No. S 344/2011).
